      "dcterms:title": "GAUSSIAN FLUCTUATIONS OF JACK-DEFORMED RANDOM YOUNG DIAGRAMS",
      "dcterms:creator": [
        "˛EGA, MACIEJ DOŁ",
        "ŚNIADY, PIOTR"
      ],
      "dcterms:issued": "D:20181109",
      "dcterms:identifier": "https://arxiv.org/abs/1704.02352",
      "dcterms:abstract": "We introduce a large class of random Young diagrams which can be regarded as a natural one-parameter deformation of some classi- cal Young diagram ensembles; a deformation which is related to Jack polynomials and Jack characters. We show that each such a random Young diagram converges asymptotically to some limit shape and that the ﬂuctuations around the limit are asymptotically Gaussian.",
